<title>USA: TABLE - CIPSCO Inc Q2 earnings up slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CIPSCO Inc Q2 earnings up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ill. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	   1996</p>
<p>Quarter ended June 30:</p>
<p> Operating Revenues (000)		    $194,918    $193,772</p>
<p> Net Income (000)				  12,249	11,982</p>
<p> Average Shares (000)			    34,070	34,070</p>
<p> Earnings per Average Share			.36*	 .35**</p>
<p>12 months ended June 30:</p>
<p> Operating Revenues (000)		     885,325     879,507</p>
<p> Net Income (000)				  74,757	79,661</p>
<p> Average Shares (000)			    34,070	34,070</p>
<p> Earnings per Average Share		   2.19***     2.34***</p>
<p>    * --   Includes unusual costs of 5 cents per share for</p>
<p>merger-related expenses, corporate restructuring and system conversion.</p>
<p>** --  Includes unusual costs of 3 cents per share for merger-related expenses.</p>
<p>*** -- Includes unusual costs of 19 cents and 31 cents for 1997 and 1996, respectively, for corporate restructuring and merger-related expenses.</p>
<p>NOTE: CIPSCO has agreed to merge wiht Union Electric Co. The transaction is pending review by regulatory agencies and is expected to be complete by the end of 1997, CIPSCO said.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
